{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23834","headline":"戊申岁暮咏怀三首 二 · 白居易","name":"戊申岁暮咏怀三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"唯生一女才十二，秪欠三年未六旬。\n婚嫁累轻何怕老，饥寒心惯不忧贫。\n紫泥丹笔皆经手，赤绂金章尽到身。\n更拟踟蹰觅何事，不归嵩洛作闲人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}